Open Standard License — STRAL-Path Reference Implementation

STRAL-Path — Structural Transition (Path Resolution Without Traversal)
Shunyaya Structural Transition Model

Legal Status

This license is a permissive Open Standard license for the STRAL-Path reference implementation.

To the maximum extent permitted by applicable law, this license grants rights similar in spirit to permissive open-source licenses, while preserving truthful representation requirements for the STRAL-Path name and reference implementation.

If any provision is found unenforceable, the remaining provisions remain in effect.

Nature of Release

This is a minimal, self-contained reference implementation.

It is intended to demonstrate a structural transition correctness model—not to represent a complete graph system, routing engine, or general-purpose pathfinding framework.

Behavioral guarantees apply only within the scope of the reference model and its defined structural assumptions.

