Responsibility

Use of STRAL-Path in real-world systems is entirely at the user’s own responsibility.

This reference implementation provides:

• deterministic structural transition resolution with reproducible visible state and certificate
• path correctness from structure
• safe handling of incomplete and conflicting structure

It does not provide:

• shortest path guarantees
• routing optimization guarantees
• real-world traversal guarantees
• system-level execution guarantees
• safety-critical assurances
• regulatory or compliance guarantees

