Closing Statement

STRAL-Path explores a simple but fundamental idea:

Path correctness emerges deterministically from structure, without traversal, search, or ordered exploration.

It is released to encourage:

• independent validation
• real-world testing
• safe experimentation

STRAL-Path is offered as a minimal reference implementation of that possibility.
